    <item>
      <title>Sonata op.5 no.7</title>
      <link>https://hsinganlee.com/performance/corelli/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 May 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://hsinganlee.com/performance/corelli/</guid>
      <description>&amp;#xD;Corelli《Sonata op.5 no.7》是義式的巴洛克奏鳴曲，並且Corelli詳細的將他對於裝飾音的品味展現在了作品當中，也是義式風格裝飾音其中一個非常具有代表性的例子。&amp;#xA;Open Recorder Days Amsterdam 2023 competition&amp;#xD;木笛： Hsing-An Lee&amp;#xD;大鍵琴： Claudio Ribeiro </description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="youtube-embed" style="max-width:900px; margin: 1.2rem 0;">
  <iframe width="100%" height="250" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/2_15FXVelt4" title="Polygatari-Matsuri" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div>
<div class="youtube-embed" style="max-width:900px; margin: 1.2rem 0;">
  <iframe width="100%" height="250" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/8NaYSDNGELU" title="Polygatari-Matsuri" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div>
<p><strong>Corelli《Sonata op.5 no.7》是義式的巴洛克奏鳴曲</strong>，並且Corelli詳細的將他對於裝飾音的品味展現在了作品當中，也是<strong>義式風格裝飾音</strong>其中一個非常具有代表性的例子。</p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code> Open Recorder Days Amsterdam 2023 competition
